@startuml
title 现有 local-intel 情报中心接入方式

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

package "Electron 桌面端" {
  [情报中心页面] as IntelPage
  [Home Dashboard] as Home
  [window.api.intel] as ApiIntel
  [window.api.system] as ApiSystem
  [IPC Router] as Ipc
  [Service Manager] as ServiceManager
  [local-intel Service Adapter] as Adapter
}

package "local-intel 现有项目" {
  [start_local_intel.ps1]
  [stop_local_intel.ps1]
  [status_local_intel.ps1]
  [app.web]
  [app.scheduler]
  [app.pipeline]
  [app.sources]
  [app.summarizer]
  [app.translator]
  [app.watchlist]
  database "data/intel.sqlite" as IntelDB
  folder "reports" as Reports
  folder "logs" as Logs
  [config.toml / interests.toml / .env] as Config
}

cloud "信息源与 LLM" {
  [GitHub Trending]
  [GitHub Releases]
  [arXiv]
  [Hacker News]
  [GDELT]
  [RSS]
  [MiMo / OpenAI-compatible]
}

IntelPage --> ApiIntel
Home --> ApiIntel
Home --> ApiSystem
ApiIntel --> Ipc
ApiSystem --> Ipc
Ipc --> ServiceManager
Ipc --> Adapter

ServiceManager --> [start_local_intel.ps1] : 启动
ServiceManager --> [stop_local_intel.ps1] : 停止
ServiceManager --> [status_local_intel.ps1] : 状态

Adapter --> [app.web] : 本地网页 / API
Adapter --> IntelDB : 读取情报数据
Adapter --> Reports : 查看报告
Adapter --> Logs : 查看运行日志
Adapter --> Config : 配置入口

[app.scheduler] --> [app.pipeline]
[app.pipeline] --> [app.sources]
[app.pipeline] --> [app.summarizer]
[app.pipeline] --> [app.translator]
[app.pipeline] --> [app.watchlist]
[app.pipeline] --> IntelDB
[app.pipeline] --> Reports
[app.pipeline] --> Logs

[app.sources] --> [GitHub Trending]
[app.sources] --> [GitHub Releases]
[app.sources] --> [arXiv]
[app.sources] --> [Hacker News]
[app.sources] --> [GDELT]
[app.sources] --> [RSS]
[app.summarizer] --> [MiMo / OpenAI-compatible]
[app.translator] --> [MiMo / OpenAI-compatible]
[app.watchlist] --> [MiMo / OpenAI-compatible]

note bottom of Adapter
接入策略：复用现有 local-intel。
Electron 负责启动、停止、健康检查、配置入口和数据展示。
不在第一版重写抓取、摘要、翻译和观察雷达逻辑。
end note

@enduml
